{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-09-08 12:32:00', 'title': 'FORTUNE RANKS AGILENT AMONG TOP WORKPLACES IN HEALTH CARE', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $A #GREATPLACETOWORK--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS BEEN NAMED A “BEST WORKPLACE IN HEALTH CARE” IN THE UNITED STATES BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE. AGILENT'S NUMBER 17 RANKING IS BASED ON THE GREAT PLACE TO WORK® EMPLOYEE SURVEY AND COMPANY-PROVIDED DATA. EIGHTY-FIVE PERCENT OF AGILENT EMPLOYEES WHO RESPONDED TO THE SURVEY INDICATED THAT THE COMPANY IS A GREAT PLACE TO WORK, COMPARED TO 57 PERCENT OF EMPLOYEES AT A TYPICAL U.S.-BASED COMPANY, RE"}